# The build context of docker-bake.hcl (context "."): only what the image is built from. The rocm-hip build reads
# Makefile, src, perl and perl-minijinja-xs; the runtime COPYs app.sh and nginx.conf. Not the Rust minijinja
# checkout, build outputs, or the rest of the repository
*
!Dockerfile
!Makefile
!src
!perl
!perl-minijinja-xs
!app.sh
!nginx.conf
perl-minijinja-xs/minijinja
perl-minijinja-xs/.git
**/blib
**/Makefile.old
**/pm_to_blib
**/MYMETA.*
**/*.o
**/*.bs
**/*.so
perl/*/Makefile
perl-minijinja-xs/Makefile
perl-minijinja-xs/lib/Minijinja.c
perl/ROCm-Inference/Inference.c
